{
  "source_commit": "ae62bf081fce0e08eebbbf2dcd8896292175bd56",
  "source_directory": "design/resource-intake-20261021",
  "bindings": [
    {
      "identity": "v111:letter_read:MS14_D01_S01_L9101",
      "index": 3,
      "text": "십삼 호. 내가 외웠어. 아빠는 짐 들어.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D01_S01_L0013",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 26,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_01_bravado",
      "key": "daram:intake21_01_bravado",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:lamp3:MS14_D03_S02_L0002",
      "index": 5,
      "text": "어제 고친다고 했잖아.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D03_S02_L0007",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 766,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_02_reproach_lean",
      "key": "daram:intake21_02_reproach_lean",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:registered:MS14_D01_S04_L0002",
      "index": 4,
      "text": "외 한 명 말고, 다람.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D01_S04_L0006",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 275,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_03_stubborn",
      "key": "daram:intake21_03_stubborn",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:gate_read_original:MS14_D01_S03_L0003",
      "index": 2,
      "text": "‘외 한 명’은 나야? 내 이름도 썼는데.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D01_S03_L0005",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 179,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_04_flustered",
      "key": "daram:intake21_04_flustered",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:portrait_commission:MS14_D02_S03_L0010",
      "index": 8,
      "text": "냄비 또 태웠다고 할 때.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D02_S03_L0018",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 535,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_05_playful_evasion",
      "key": "daram:intake21_05_playful_evasion",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:clinic3:MS14_D03_S03_L0013",
      "index": 7,
      "text": "아빠. 초롱은 돌이 있었댔잖아. 이 사람은 언제 꺼냈는데?",
      "line_id": "MS14_D03_S03_L0020",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 845,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_06_eureka",
      "key": "daram:intake21_06_eureka",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:restore3:MS14_D03_S06_L0002",
      "index": 1,
      "text": "따뜻해.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D03_S06_L0003",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 1248,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_07_delighted",
      "key": "daram:intake21_07_delighted",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:silluk3:MS14_D03_S04_L0002",
      "index": 1,
      "text": "아빠, 비켜.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D03_S04_L0003",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 897,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_08_scared_brave",
      "key": "daram:intake21_08_scared_brave",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:piko_memorial:MS14_D03_S06_L0013",
      "index": 4,
      "text": "약속은 내가 했는데, 피코는 못 왔네.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D03_S06_L0018",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 1286,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_09_wipe_tears",
      "key": "daram:intake21_09_wipe_tears",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:shelter_prepare:MS14_D02_S04_L0024",
      "index": 3,
      "text": "그림 내가 들게. 안 눌리게.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D02_S04_L0027",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 629,
      "person": "daram",
      "slot": "intake21_10_resolve",
      "key": "daram:intake21_10_resolve",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "person": "kid_kkomi",
      "slot": "intake21_kkomi_anxious",
      "identity": "wf:hideout:refuse",
      "index": 1,
      "text": "학교는 표 있는 애들 데잖아. 거기 가면 어른들이 이름 물어보고, 그러다 보호소 보내.",
      "key": "kid_kkomi:intake21_kkomi_anxious",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "person": "kid_kkomi",
      "slot": "intake21_kkomi_joy",
      "identity": "st:kkomi_class",
      "index": 1,
      "text": "이게 꼬, 이게 미. 대장 이름부터 외워.",
      "key": "kid_kkomi:intake21_kkomi_joy",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "person": "kid_dodam",
      "slot": "intake21_dodam_joy",
      "identity": "st:dodam",
      "index": 3,
      "text": "(작게) 휘휘 저어라 겨울 수프, 감자 하나 당근 하나……",
      "key": "kid_dodam:intake21_dodam_joy",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "person": "kid_saemi",
      "slot": "intake21_saemi_anxious",
      "identity": "ws:soup:all",
      "index": 0,
      "text": "일어나. 일어나, 도담아. 불 켜졌어. 따뜻해졌어.",
      "key": "kid_saemi:intake21_saemi_anxious",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "person": "resident_ubak",
      "slot": "intake21_ubak_anxious",
      "identity": "ep1:ubak",
      "index": 3,
      "text": "그 아주머니가…… 저 때문이에요?",
      "key": "resident_ubak:intake21_ubak_anxious",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    },
    {
      "identity": "v111:clinic3:MS14_D03_S03_L0013",
      "index": 10,
      "text": "말을 끝까지 좀 들으세요.",
      "line_id": "MS14_D03_S03_L0023",
      "source": "game/room13_v111_days123.rpy",
      "source_line": 845,
      "person": "resident_ubak",
      "slot": "intake21_ubak_angry",
      "key": "resident_ubak:intake21_ubak_angry",
      "batch": "resource-intake-20261021"
    }
  ],
